::  name       aurora seed length equality gate
::  shape      length - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 exactly when length is seed_length=32; answers 0 otherwise
::  example    32 -> 1 · 31 -> 0 · 33 -> 0
::  readers    Aurora · Glow Tend a1 unfinished · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-e252-equality-first-v0 · STOA337
::
::  Ashvini equality · first pedestal gth cannot speak. The sur shape names
::  seed_length=32; this gate decides *exactly*, not by a ceiling.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (eq sample 32)  1  0
